finalize() method is called by Garbage Collector on an object before destroying it.
When Garbage Collector calls finalize() method on an object, it ignores all the exceptions raised in the method.

we have to clear about one fact about Garbage Collector i.e. it will call finalize() method on a particular object exactly one time.

